name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q4_2026-pilot'

question 'Which of the following is the BEST reason to test an AI tool multiple times before relying on its output?'

wrong 'Testing multiple times will teach the AI to give better answers in the future.'
wrong 'AI tools give different answers every time, so no answer can ever be trusted.'
wrong 'Testing once is enough as long as you get an answer that sounds reasonable.'
right 'Repeated testing helps you identify patterns in the AI\'s outputs, including errors and limitations.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

